flowchart TD
    Start([User logs in]) --> NavDecks[Clicks 'My Decks' in sidebar]
    NavDecks --> DeckListPage[DeckList page loads]
    DeckListPage --> HasDecks{Has decks?}

    HasDecks -->|No| EmptyState[Shows empty state]
    EmptyState --> ClickImport[Clicks 'Import Deck']
    HasDecks -->|Yes| ShowGrid[Shows deck grid cards]
    ShowGrid --> ClickImport
    ShowGrid --> ClickDeck[Clicks a deck card]

    ClickImport --> ImportModal[Import modal opens]
    ImportModal --> FillForm[Fills name, format, content]
    FillForm --> Submit[Clicks 'Import']
    Submit --> ParseDeck{Parse deck text/CSV}
    ParseDeck --> LinkCards[Match cards to canonical DB]
    LinkCards --> StoreDeck[Store deck + cards in DB]
    StoreDeck --> RefreshList[Refresh deck list]
    RefreshList --> ShowGrid

    ClickDeck --> DeckViewPage[DeckView page loads]
    DeckViewPage --> ShowHeader[Show deck name, description, stats]
    DeckViewPage --> ShowCards[Show card grid with ownership overlay]

    ShowCards --> OwnedCard{Card in collection?}
    OwnedCard -->|Yes| ClickOwned[Click navigates to /collection/:id]
    OwnedCard -->|No| ShowOverlay[Darkened overlay + 'Not Owned']
    ShowOverlay --> ClickUnowned[Click navigates to /cards/:card_id]

    DeckViewPage --> ClickDelete[Clicks 'Delete']
    ClickDelete --> ConfirmModal[Confirmation dialog]
    ConfirmModal -->|Confirm| DeleteDeck[DELETE /api/v1/decks/:id]
    DeleteDeck --> RedirectList[Redirect to /decks]
    ConfirmModal -->|Cancel| DeckViewPage
